-- חוק עבודת נשים, התשי"ד-1954 — section 7א: an employer who was paying into
-- a provident fund for an employee keeps paying for the whole period for
-- which maternity pay or the pregnancy-protection benefit is paid, at the
-- rates and on the salary as though the employee had gone on working. The
-- text is laws/womens-work-law.toml, pinned from the live page of ספר החוקים
-- הפתוח; the corpus holds no copy. A pension fund and a study fund are both
-- provident funds ("קופת גמל" as the provident-funds law defines it).

IMPORT prelude

§ `חוק עבודת נשים — הפרשות לקופת גמל בתקופת לידה ושמירת הריון`

§§ `7א`

-- (א): the employer keeps paying for the weeks maternity pay was paid and
-- the weeks the pregnancy-protection benefit was paid, if contributions
-- were being paid (by both, or by the employer alone) and the employee paid
-- her own part for the period. (ב): only an employer the employee worked
-- for at least six months right before the pregnancy began; for the weeks
-- of maternity pay, also only if they were employed throughout the
-- pregnancy. (ג): the minister sets dates and rules for paying; no rule
-- here turns on them.
@ref law:7א
GIVEN `weeks maternity pay was paid` IS A NUMBER
      `weeks the pregnancy-protection benefit was paid` IS A NUMBER
      `contributions were being paid` IS A BOOLEAN
      `employed six months right before the pregnancy` IS A BOOLEAN
      `employed throughout the pregnancy` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `weeks the employer keeps contributing` `weeks maternity pay was paid` `weeks the pregnancy-protection benefit was paid` `contributions were being paid` `employed six months right before the pregnancy` `employed throughout the pregnancy` IS
    IF `contributions were being paid` AND `employed six months right before the pregnancy`
    THEN `weeks the pregnancy-protection benefit was paid`
         PLUS (IF `employed throughout the pregnancy` THEN `weeks maternity pay was paid` ELSE 0)
    ELSE 0

#ASSERT `weeks the employer keeps contributing` 15 0 TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS 15
#ASSERT `weeks the employer keeps contributing` 15 8 TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS 23
#ASSERT `weeks the employer keeps contributing` 15 8 TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS 8
#ASSERT `weeks the employer keeps contributing` 15 8 TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS 0
